# Member Portal Registry — Manifest Schema (PS-2)

**Authority:** Mirrors operator `SettingsModuleManifest` (Phase 9.6). Codegen source: `workspace.manifest.json` → `packages/workspace-sdk/src/portal/workspace-member-portal-surfaces.generated.ts`.

## 1. Block shape

```json
{
  "memberPortal": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "defaultPrimaryModuleId": "trips",
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": "trips",
        "routePath": "/me/registrations",
        "nav": { "tier": "primary", "labelKey": "trips" }
      },
      {
        "id": "profile",
        "routePath": "/me/profile",
        "nav": { "tier": "user_menu", "labelKey": "profile" }
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

| Field | Type | Required | Notes |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----- |
| `manifestVersion` | `1` | yes | Breaking changes bump version |
| `defaultPrimaryModuleId` | string | yes | Portal `/` and bare `/me` redirect target (DL-06, DL-40) |
| `modules` | array | yes | Non-empty; unique `id` values |

## 2. Module entry

| Field | Type | Required | Notes |
| ----- | ---- | -------- | ----- |
| `id` | string | yes | Stable module id; see reserved ids §3 |
| `routePath` | string | yes | Must match `^/me/` and not equal `/me` |
| `nav.tier` | enum | yes | `primary` · `secondary` · `hidden` · `user_menu` |
| `nav.labelKey` | string | yes | Key under `portalMember.nav` i18n namespace |

### 2.1 Navigation tiers

| Tier | Max | Renderer (portal) |
| ---- | --- | ----------------- |
| `primary` | **5** (hard fail) | Bottom nav |
| `secondary` | N | More hub (future) |
| `hidden` | N | Deep link only |
| `user_menu` | N | Header user menu |

### 2.2 Entitlement default grant (PS-6)

| Tier | Included in default `granted` without membership override |
| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| `primary`, `secondary`, `user_menu` | yes |
| `hidden` | **no** — requires `membershipMetadata.portalModuleGrants` module id |

Evaluator: `evaluateMemberPortalEntitlements` in `@app-tour/workspace-sdk`. See [platform-portal-member-entitlements.mdoc](../platform-portal-member-entitlements.mdoc) §3.2.

**Phase 2 Denali binding:** Only `trips` (primary) and `profile` (user_menu) — routes that exist today. Full reference IA (Home · Trips · Wallet · Membership · More) lands when routes ship (BP-4+).

## 3. Reserved module ids (DL-30)

Codegen **fail-closed** if workspace declares:

| id | Class |
| -- | ----- |
| `home` | Platform-owned — injected at BP-4; route `/me/home` |
| `more` | Shell hub slot — route `/me/more` when secondary modules exist (PS-6) |
| `api` | BFF namespace |
| `catalog` | Registration namespace |

Error code: `MEMBER_PORTAL_RESERVED_MODULE_ID:{id}`.

## 4. Codegen validation

| Rule | Error code |
| ---- | ---------- |
| Duplicate module ids | `MEMBER_PORTAL_DUPLICATE_ID:{id}` |
| >5 `primary` tier modules | `MEMBER_PORTAL_PRIMARY_OVERFLOW` |
| Reserved id declared | `MEMBER_PORTAL_RESERVED_MODULE_ID:{id}` |
| Invalid `routePath` root | `MEMBER_PORTAL_INVALID_ROUTE:{routePath}` |
| `defaultPrimaryModuleId` not in `modules` | `MEMBER_PORTAL_UNKNOWN_DEFAULT:{id}` |
| Unknown `nav.tier` | `MEMBER_PORTAL_UNKNOWN_NAV_TIER:{tier}` |

## 5. Generated API (`@app-tour/workspace-sdk`)

| Export | Purpose |
| ------ | ------- |
| `WORKSPACE_MEMBER_PORTAL_SURFACES` | Frozen manifest map keyed by `pluginId` |
| `resolveMemberPortalModules(pluginId)` | Full surface for shell + BFF |
| `resolveMemberPortalDefaultRoutePath(pluginId)` | Route for `defaultPrimaryModuleId` |
| `resolveMemberPortalModuleRoutePath(pluginId, moduleId)` | Per-module route (GSH PS-3) |
| `resolveMemberPortalModuleByRoutePath(pluginId, routePath)` | Reverse lookup for dispatcher (PS-5 / DL-24) |
| `listMemberPortalEntitlementKeys(pluginId)` | All entitlement keys for effective registry (PS-5) |
| `evaluateMemberPortalEntitlements(pluginId, options?)` | Tier-aware `granted` + `denied` (PS-6) |
| `validateMemberPortalManifest(modules, defaultPrimaryModuleId)` | Runtime/test validation |
| `MemberPortalNotConfiguredError` | Fail-closed when block absent |

## 6. L4 conformance (DL-07, DL-18)

| Phase | Enforcement |
| ----- | ----------- |
| PS-2 | Codegen **warn** if L3 workspace (not Denali reference) declares `memberPortal` |
| PS-5 | CI **fail** if Denali lacks block; urban/starter exempt |
| **PS-6** | `WORKSPACE_GUEST_CONFORMANCE_LEVELS` emits **`L4`** when L3 criteria + `memberPortal` block; guard fails if reference workspace (`denali`) is not L4 |

L4 = L3 guest conformance + required `memberPortal` for workspaces shipping member-app navigation.

### 6.1 More hub (PS-6 / DL-10)

| Tier | Renderer | Route |
| ---- | -------- | ----- |
| `secondary` | More hub list | `/me/more` (platform shell slot — not declared in manifest) |

| Secondary module count | Presentation |
| ---------------------- | ------------ |
| 0 | No More nav slot |
| 1–24 | Plain list (`data-portal-member-hub-mode="plain"`) |
| 25+ | Virtualised scroll container (`data-portal-member-hub-mode="virtualised"`) — full windowing Phase 7 |

SDK: `resolveMemberPortalHubPresentation`, `MEMBER_PORTAL_HUB_VIRTUALISATION_THRESHOLD` (25).

## 7. Regenerate

```bash
pnpm run generate:workspace-registry
```

Manifest diff without regenerated output fails `guard-guest-plugin-conformance` (`--check`).

## 8. Platform-owned merge (PS-5 / BP-4, DL-30)

Workspace codegen emits **workspace-declared** modules only. At runtime, `resolveMemberPortalModules` merges platform-owned rows **before** workspace modules:

| id | routePath | nav.tier | Source |
| -- | --------- | -------- | ------ |
| `home` | `/me/home` | `primary` | `platform-member-portal-modules.ts` |

**Invariants:**

- Workspace manifests **MUST NOT** declare `home` — codegen fail-closed (`MEMBER_PORTAL_RESERVED_MODULE_ID:home`).
- `defaultPrimaryModuleId` remains workspace-owned (Denali: `trips` → `/me/registrations` until explicit default migration).
- Portal `/` and bare `/me` redirect via `resolveMemberPortalDefaultRoutePath` — **not** hardcoded alias paths.
- Entitlement keys: `member.module.{id}` for every effective module (including platform `home`).

**Portal route:** `apps/portal/app/me/home/page.tsx` — consumes `GET /api/me/home` aggregate (DL-19). Unknown registry routes fall through to `app/me/[...modulePath]/page.tsx` dispatcher (static routes win — DL-28).

## 9. Module dispatcher (PS-5 / DL-24, DL-28)

| Route pattern | Handler |
| ------------- | ------- |
| `/me/registrations`, `/me/profile`, `/me/home` | Static `app/me/*/page.tsx` (wins over catch-all) |
| `/me/{unknown}` | `app/me/[...modulePath]/page.tsx` — registry lookup + entitlement check |
| `/me` | `app/me/page.tsx` — redirect to `defaultPrimaryModuleId` |

**Unauthorized module (DL-21):** dispatcher renders in-portal 403 (`data-portal-member-unauthorized`) — not marketing redirect.

## 10. Traceability

| Artifact | Path |
| -------- | ---- |
| Types | `packages/workspace-sdk/src/portal/member-module-manifest.ts` |
| Platform merge | `packages/workspace-sdk/src/portal/platform-member-portal-modules.ts` |
| Generated map | `packages/workspace-sdk/src/portal/workspace-member-portal-surfaces.generated.ts` |
| Resolver | `packages/workspace-sdk/src/portal/resolve-member-portal-modules.ts` |
| Dispatcher | `apps/portal/app/me/[...modulePath]/page.tsx` |
| Codegen | `scripts/generate-workspace-registry.mjs` → `assertMemberPortalManifest` |
| Denali manifest | `packages/workspaces/denali/workspace.manifest.json` |
| Portal consumer | `apps/portal/src/shell/*`, `apps/portal/app/me/page.tsx`, `apps/portal/app/me/home/page.tsx` |
| Guard | `scripts/guards/guard-member-portal-registry.mjs` |
